{
    "title": "Spider Solitaire",
    "description": "<b>Spider Solitaire</b> is a classic and amazing solitaire card games to train your brain and relax your life! Bet you will say loudly \"Fantastic!\" when you playing this Spider Solitaire card game. If you like classic card games like Klondike Solitaire, TriPeak Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, Spades, and Hearts, this Spider Solitaire is really for you!\r\n\r\nThe <b>Spider Solitaire</b> is classic solitaire card game but not rigid. You can choose your favorite backgrounds, card faces, card backs, and even the victory animations after you win a game. There are 100+ backgrounds and card backs in this spider solitaire.\r\n\r\nThis fantastic Spider Solitaire has daily challenges waiting for you. When you do daily challenges for several days, you will get a gift box; when you do daily challenges for a month, you will get a trophy. Daily challenges make the Spider Solitaire more interesting. You can play 1 Suit at the begining, and if you want to challenge yourself or try your luck, you can play 2 Suit and 4 Suit.\r\n\r\nSpider Solitaire has other game play around the card games, such as sea adventure pass, designing your garden or house, collecting stars to unlock more themes, and so on.\r\n\r\nInstall Spider Solitaire now! Play this solitaire card game, it is more than you imagine!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Spider Solitaire</b> is a classic and amazing solitaire card games to train your brain and relax your life! Bet you will say loudly &quot;Fantastic!&quot; when you playing this Spider Solitaire card game. If you like classic card games like Klondike Solitaire, TriPeak Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, Spades, and Hearts, this Spider Solitaire is really for you!<br><br>The <b>Spider Solitaire</b> is classic solitaire card game but not rigid. You can choose your favorite backgrounds, card faces, card backs, and even the victory animations after you win a game. There are 100+ backgrounds and card backs in this spider solitaire.<br><br>This fantastic Spider Solitaire has daily challenges waiting for you. When you do daily challenges for several days, you will get a gift box; when you do daily challenges for a month, you will get a trophy. Daily challenges make the Spider Solitaire more interesting. You can play 1 Suit at the begining, and if you want to challenge yourself or try your luck, you can play 2 Suit and 4 Suit.<br><br>Spider Solitaire has other game play around the card games, such as sea adventure pass, designing your garden or house, collecting stars to unlock more themes, and so on.<br><br>Install Spider Solitaire now! Play this solitaire card game, it is more than you imagine!",
    "summary": "Spider Solitaire - The classic & cool solitaire card games to train your brain!",
